[{:db/id "q-12018/selection/4a7ccc61558c6154d0bfba037d357224ced364a2e96d0451ba9ac183b90f8f21" :answer/id #uuid "a990e253-b3a4-5d59-b6e5-c06d24c3b06a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3(2x-3)^{3}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12018/selection/52a8a888d69e14facbf6acaecf72e3aaf941e2fa87ec803446b08dee76fb9a7c" :answer/id #uuid "cf405392-15e5-5454-af1a-280b01969c42" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3(2x-3)^{3}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12018/selection/e568f39e905f6e2332c33649dbb7da01c114e335dc8ff4f65150dfbe04c50f77" :answer/id #uuid "9d396a8c-0a15-5ddb-af03-bb2c4cead9ff" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{(2x-3)^{3}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12018/selection/d09863f935eb8a5f9bfbc53a06d44e06b867a56eb1ad767be583cee7f042cf3d" :answer/id #uuid "9b109a4d-c456-5841-b777-442d36055c46" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{(2x-3)^{3}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12018/selection/f908a3fa092c2adecd4ca72a8691d60e88fb9a3c9c8b3ae7cbb55771a9fb1151" :answer/id #uuid "89ad5c01-b932-56ae-8068-44b86976256a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{6}{(2x-3)^{3}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12018/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "67b49cf0-1d85-5436-ab3f-6617d0b013f1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-12018/selection/d09863f935eb8a5f9bfbc53a06d44e06b867a56eb1ad767be583cee7f042cf3d" :answer-field/choices ["q-12018/selection/4a7ccc61558c6154d0bfba037d357224ced364a2e96d0451ba9ac183b90f8f21" "q-12018/selection/52a8a888d69e14facbf6acaecf72e3aaf941e2fa87ec803446b08dee76fb9a7c" "q-12018/selection/e568f39e905f6e2332c33649dbb7da01c114e335dc8ff4f65150dfbe04c50f77" "q-12018/selection/d09863f935eb8a5f9bfbc53a06d44e06b867a56eb1ad767be583cee7f042cf3d" "q-12018/selection/f908a3fa092c2adecd4ca72a8691d60e88fb9a3c9c8b3ae7cbb55771a9fb1151"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-12018" :question/id #uuid "f402bba5-eaa5-542e-ba47-73c83d9ce48d" :question/math-academy-id "q-12018" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{6}{(2x-3)^{4}}\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the integral as\n\n$$\n\\int 6(2x-3)^{-4}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nLet $u=2x-3.$Then differentiating with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=2\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nWe now write our integral in terms of $u,$ calculate the integral as normal, and write the final answer in terms of $x$ at the very end:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 6(2x-3)^{-4}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int 6{u}^{-4}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =3\\int {u}^{-4}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =3\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{3}){u}^{-3}+C \\\\  & =-{u}^{-3}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{{u}^{3}}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{(2x-3)^{3}}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's double-check that our result is correct. If we differentiate the result, then it should come out to the original integrand:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[-\\frac{1}{(2x-3)^{3}}+C] & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[-\\frac{1}{(2x-3)^{3}}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[(2x-3)^{-3}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =-(-3)\\cdot (2x-3)^{-4}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2x-3)+0 \\\\  & =3\\cdot (2x-3)^{-4}\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =\\frac{6}{(2x-3)^{4}}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-12018/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "387d85df-b839-5837-89b9-5e4bb4daa073"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-12018"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-49431/selection/59e257b97ed92e5e1f17b1f42e77c45c0f027805eadf620728a4d0b5f937db25" :answer/id #uuid "a733e1d0-caf5-53a4-b41e-ac894295a0f0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2\\sqrt{1-9z}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49431/selection/b92cddec5469d97b82ca517ff52bb4658d2d37c298c53b68ac55e5c190f8055c" :answer/id #uuid "6ee381b6-74cc-5933-bbce-4f3a2c84d262" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\sqrt{(1-9z)^{3}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49431/selection/7e4d24ea6896c16fb7fa14d971401602997a01d6b44e1f9f2d5882b84677eccf" :answer/id #uuid "335d4a4f-8a5e-5e3e-b000-15aea73bd85e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{2}{9}\\sqrt{1-9z}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49431/selection/36f43b5d1fdb762cc1e2a49ea0f72b0ea6b62bb4571f57f3d27879816e2df7cb" :answer/id #uuid "61bbdade-e0e6-5726-b5b4-d780cd95fef1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{2}{9}\\sqrt{(1-9z)^{3}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49431/selection/8833382ff5574c7ddf00b9d79f3706e221c5899f9d9e82d4cc0d51f475310541" :answer/id #uuid "82034522-e066-5cba-902c-11a76a304253" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9\\sqrt{1-9z}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49431/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "0e45116f-a3fa-59bc-b604-14c6ecf24e54" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-49431/selection/7e4d24ea6896c16fb7fa14d971401602997a01d6b44e1f9f2d5882b84677eccf" :answer-field/choices ["q-49431/selection/59e257b97ed92e5e1f17b1f42e77c45c0f027805eadf620728a4d0b5f937db25" "q-49431/selection/b92cddec5469d97b82ca517ff52bb4658d2d37c298c53b68ac55e5c190f8055c" "q-49431/selection/7e4d24ea6896c16fb7fa14d971401602997a01d6b44e1f9f2d5882b84677eccf" "q-49431/selection/36f43b5d1fdb762cc1e2a49ea0f72b0ea6b62bb4571f57f3d27879816e2df7cb" "q-49431/selection/8833382ff5574c7ddf00b9d79f3706e221c5899f9d9e82d4cc0d51f475310541"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-49431" :question/id #uuid "78d0396e-82eb-542b-a43f-b6df87f217ac" :question/math-academy-id "q-49431" :question/problem "Calculate $\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-9z}}\\,\\text{d}z.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the integral as\n\n$$\n\\int (1-9z)^{-1/2}\\,\\text{d}z.\n$$\n\nNow, we let $u=1-9z.$ Then differentiating with respect to $z$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}z}=-9\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}z=-\\frac{1}{9}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nWe now write our integral in terms of $u,$ calculate the integral as normal, and write the final answer in terms of $u$ at the very end:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (1-9z)^{-1/2}\\,\\text{d}z & =\\int {u}^{-1/2}\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{9}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{9}\\int {u}^{-1/2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{9}\\frac{1}{(1/2)}{u}^{1/2}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{9}{u}^{1/2}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{9}(1-9z)^{1/2}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{9}\\sqrt{1-9z}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's double-check that our result is correct. If we differentiate the result, then it should come out to the original integrand:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}z}[-\\frac{2}{9}\\sqrt{1-9z}+C] & =-\\frac{2}{9}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}z}[\\sqrt{1-9z}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}z}(C) \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{9}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}z}[(1-9z)^{1/2}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}z}(C) \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{9}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}(1-9z)^{-1/2}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}z}(1-9z)+0 \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{9}\\cdot (1-9z)^{-1/2}\\cdot (-9) \\\\  & =(1-9z)^{-1/2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-9z}}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-49431/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0ae5760b-9277-596c-8546-dca4fd985bd7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-49431"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-49437/selection/6e434311fad76f733512d8092ccb1ce35df21696e3ccb0d1abc712163e2444bd" :answer/id #uuid "69ef12d7-402a-50fb-b096-c48bd22ccc9a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{8}\\sqrt[3]{(y+11)^{8}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49437/selection/f329b80045450c8cb93620714588c23396226f9f7bca9979c786da63b6c23a60" :answer/id #uuid "544473ea-e71e-5508-ad79-16c54f6b5568" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt[3]{(y+11)^{8}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49437/selection/d9b76213262275abad7b21b39d43e411b74bc3f89c09aabaaf458fe020c00028" :answer/id #uuid "7c899c38-cbe7-534f-861a-a14f320c2c78" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8\\sqrt[3]{(y+11)^{5}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49437/selection/b45d53946412ddb2b4ef5d950b19dbb4fc3c5fcf1c78d358e2501c80b18aed9c" :answer/id #uuid "38f74021-d5fb-5bf5-a0b0-33a371ed29f6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\sqrt[3]{(y+11)^{8}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49437/selection/78de71fb0966e6071f7edd2a82128d84ce35e370b8bff8b47b71a0dfad9d358a" :answer/id #uuid "1f6d28a2-78f9-5a9b-8b12-757937c5b95d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{8}{3}\\sqrt[3]{(y+11)^{2}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49437/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "a7619ece-38ea-59d2-a313-65f7b590f0ee" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-49437/selection/6e434311fad76f733512d8092ccb1ce35df21696e3ccb0d1abc712163e2444bd" :answer-field/choices ["q-49437/selection/6e434311fad76f733512d8092ccb1ce35df21696e3ccb0d1abc712163e2444bd" "q-49437/selection/f329b80045450c8cb93620714588c23396226f9f7bca9979c786da63b6c23a60" "q-49437/selection/d9b76213262275abad7b21b39d43e411b74bc3f89c09aabaaf458fe020c00028" "q-49437/selection/b45d53946412ddb2b4ef5d950b19dbb4fc3c5fcf1c78d358e2501c80b18aed9c" "q-49437/selection/78de71fb0966e6071f7edd2a82128d84ce35e370b8bff8b47b71a0dfad9d358a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-49437" :question/id #uuid "a7f9bd93-5375-50fc-95cf-f71de7f34eef" :question/math-academy-id "q-49437" :question/problem "Calculate the integral $\\int \\sqrt[3]{(y+11)^{5}}\\,\\text{d}y.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the integral as\n\n$$\n\\int (y+11)^{5/3}\\,\\text{d}y.\n$$\n\nNow, we let $u=y+11.$ Then differentiating with respect to $y$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}y}=1\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}y=\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nWe now write our integral in terms of $u,$ calculate the integral as normal, and write the final answer in terms of $u$ at the very end:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (y+11)^{5/3}\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int {u}^{5/3}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{{u}^{8/3}}{8/3}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{8}(y+11)^{8/3}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{8}\\sqrt[3]{(y+11)^{8}}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's double-check that our result is correct. If we differentiate the result, then it should come out to the original integrand:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}[\\frac{3}{8}\\sqrt[3]{(y+11)^{8}}] & =\\frac{3}{8}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}[\\sqrt[3]{(y+11)^{8}}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}(C) \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{8}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}[(y+11)^{8/3}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}(C) \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{8}\\cdot \\frac{8}{3}(y+11)^{5/3}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}(y+11)+0 \\\\  & =(y+11)^{5/3}\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =\\sqrt[3]{(y+11)^{5}}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-49437/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0ae5760b-9277-596c-8546-dca4fd985bd7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-49437"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-49468/selection/1713b69c60f2939a9b17aad2130db2fc7631f64062cf3744498de211a148b0fb" :answer/id #uuid "ff0f7e33-76e7-5e56-978c-f942b65e6a38" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5\\sqrt[5]{{(s+1)}^{3}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49468/selection/ae0b08f9eadea9dc733167885b6ab02db28a1c5037f474d3b2ef0fd6cdf8b81c" :answer/id #uuid "5d83df84-2574-5210-a7f2-2bda41daf14b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt[5]{{(s+1)}^{3}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49468/selection/a20ddc92c278bfee059db77148671abcf7188a9a7082d11524c223e760613926" :answer/id #uuid "8df04daa-221c-5ae1-b949-9dbef49ab348" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt[5]{{(s+1)}^{2}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49468/selection/7a5f3ce7b330c10d2531acacab99f1128dd2a7f3e27823a835266036416059c0" :answer/id #uuid "8f1775d3-358d-5b89-b0d3-396a700f8e42" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\sqrt[5]{{(s+1)}^{2}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49468/selection/d3553828190ba618bd96e797e7e0114fa8895d7e7dc1e44c21ce6a856e4e531d" :answer/id #uuid "7725a6f2-3735-5fd8-b9b7-ab6aa07a304b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{2}\\sqrt[5]{{(s+1)}^{2}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49468/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "30357bab-78f2-55e1-8f33-6fcf7e0bb188" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-49468/selection/d3553828190ba618bd96e797e7e0114fa8895d7e7dc1e44c21ce6a856e4e531d" :answer-field/choices ["q-49468/selection/1713b69c60f2939a9b17aad2130db2fc7631f64062cf3744498de211a148b0fb" "q-49468/selection/ae0b08f9eadea9dc733167885b6ab02db28a1c5037f474d3b2ef0fd6cdf8b81c" "q-49468/selection/a20ddc92c278bfee059db77148671abcf7188a9a7082d11524c223e760613926" "q-49468/selection/7a5f3ce7b330c10d2531acacab99f1128dd2a7f3e27823a835266036416059c0" "q-49468/selection/d3553828190ba618bd96e797e7e0114fa8895d7e7dc1e44c21ce6a856e4e531d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-49468" :question/id #uuid "2058ea27-d95b-5f37-8b22-5c724bfe6f2c" :question/math-academy-id "q-49468" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt[5]{{(s+1)}^{3}}}\\,\\text{d}s=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the integral as\n\n$$\n\\int {(s+1)}^{-3/5}\\,\\text{d}s.\n$$\n\nNow, we let  $u=s+1.$ Then differentiating with respect to $s$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}s}=1\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}s=\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nWe now write our integral in terms of $u,$ calculate the integral as normal, and write the final answer in terms of $u$ at the very end:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {(s+1)}^{-3/5}\\,\\text{d}s & =\\int {u}^{-3/5}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2/5}{u}^{2/5}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}{u}^{2/5}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}{(s+1)}^{2/5}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}\\sqrt[5]{{(s+1)}^{2}}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's double-check that our result is correct. If we differentiate the result, then it should come out to the original integrand:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}s}[\\frac{5}{2}\\sqrt[5]{{(s+1)}^{2}}+C] & =\\frac{5}{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}s}[\\sqrt[5]{{(s+1)}^{2}}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}s}(C) \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}s}[{(s+1)}^{2/5}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}s}(C) \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}\\cdot \\frac{2}{5}{(s+1)}^{-3/5}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}s}(s+1)+0 \\\\  & ={(s+1)}^{-3/5}\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt[5]{{(s+1)}^{3}}}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-49468/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0ae5760b-9277-596c-8546-dca4fd985bd7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-49468"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-72429/selection/a80bc0b2fc697c0e2a327dffaa70b8eeae029e0bf67a5016666b1ca81c7304d7" :answer/id #uuid "6755725f-7aed-5c17-a2bf-fcfb68304cbe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{(5x-7)^{3}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72429/selection/3387efaa513ba0ab9466544752a213b49e4ccc4fe5d2123ddea601820a5b1311" :answer/id #uuid "1d0bcbeb-6bad-5455-80d0-9e4abbcc2df4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{5}{(5x-7)^{3}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72429/selection/aa6a8b21a3e7f48daf5868de1d628f1fe81993b23efd0892622dc2ac21cc5925" :answer/id #uuid "b8a509eb-a4d5-5298-b485-63a3d5563538" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{15}{(5x-7)^{3}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72429/selection/50cefa110a28f3c52c71426d9d9b3e2d230321a013658573b7a09ef4c4ef8255" :answer/id #uuid "49641b55-437c-50ae-8f9a-753a66d04084" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{(5x-7)^{3}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72429/selection/e585e4aff8b0beba1d6dfd88a24e230ed6d570e81b4abc1a60a7ec122d1e744f" :answer/id #uuid "9e033727-9c32-57f8-b869-e09491691fc2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{(5x-7)^{3}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72429/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "dc21d131-2d3a-5323-b643-13e942c8a711" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-72429/selection/e585e4aff8b0beba1d6dfd88a24e230ed6d570e81b4abc1a60a7ec122d1e744f" :answer-field/choices ["q-72429/selection/a80bc0b2fc697c0e2a327dffaa70b8eeae029e0bf67a5016666b1ca81c7304d7" "q-72429/selection/3387efaa513ba0ab9466544752a213b49e4ccc4fe5d2123ddea601820a5b1311" "q-72429/selection/aa6a8b21a3e7f48daf5868de1d628f1fe81993b23efd0892622dc2ac21cc5925" "q-72429/selection/50cefa110a28f3c52c71426d9d9b3e2d230321a013658573b7a09ef4c4ef8255" "q-72429/selection/e585e4aff8b0beba1d6dfd88a24e230ed6d570e81b4abc1a60a7ec122d1e744f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-72429" :question/id #uuid "3764bbdf-f69f-58d6-a98a-c5240e17e994" :question/math-academy-id "q-72429" :question/problem "$\\int -\\frac{15}{(5x-7)^{4}}\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the integral as\n\n$$\n\\int -15(5x-7)^{-4}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nLet $u=5x-7.$Then differentiating with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=5\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{5}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nWe now write our integral in terms of $u,$ calculate the integral as normal, and write the final answer in terms of $x$ at the very end:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int -15(5x-7)^{-4}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int -15{u}^{-4}\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-3\\int {u}^{-4}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-3\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{3}){u}^{-3}+C \\\\  & ={u}^{-3}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{{u}^{3}}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{(5x-7)^{3}}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's double-check that our result is correct. If we differentiate the result, then it should come out to the original integrand:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[\\frac{1}{(5x-7)^{3}}+C] & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[\\frac{1}{(5x-7)^{3}}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[(5x-7)^{-3}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =-3\\cdot (5x-7)^{-4}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(5x-7)+0 \\\\  & =-3\\cdot (5x-7)^{-4}\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =-\\frac{15}{(5x-7)^{4}}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-72429/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "387d85df-b839-5837-89b9-5e4bb4daa073"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-72429"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
